{
  "dom_id": "step-e5134",
  "name": "Example: Multiplying Rational Expressions by Factoring and Canceling Common Terms",
  "problem": "Simplify $\\dfrac {3p - 12}{p^2 - 9} \\cdot \\dfrac {p + 3} {p - 4}.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we factor all of the expressions and cancel any terms that appear in both a numerator and a denominator. Then, we multiply the numerators and the denominators as follows:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\dfrac {3p - 12}{p^2 - 9} \\cdot \\dfrac {p + 3} {p - 4} \n\t\t&=\\dfrac {3(p - 4)} {(p + 3)(p - 3)} \\cdot \\dfrac {p + 3} {p - 4} \\[5pt]\n\t\t&=\\dfrac {3\\cancel{(p - 4)}} {\\cancel{(p + 3)}(p - 3)} \\cdot \\dfrac {\\cancel{p + 3}} {\\cancel{p - 4}} \\[5pt]\n\t\t&=\\dfrac {3}{p - 3}\n\n\t}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e5134\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Multiplying Rational Expressions by Factoring and Canceling Common Terms</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e5134\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpa